                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this before but it was a long time ago so I don't know if I ran into the same issues but I think I did and is why I couldn't get certain achievements.  I like the graphics and over all game however the big issue I had which makes this a game unplayable if you want to do the mini games is many of them where you had to move pieces do not work.  I tried using the game cursor and tried unchecking that but still the same.  The cursor is a hand.  So every game that has this mechanic what happens if you try to move pieces you may have to place and you simply can not do it.  I tried again and again.  I can play the game but I had to skip multiple mini games which takes away a good chunk of the game play.",
